The dictionary files under `dict/` come from OpenCC
(https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC) and are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
See `dict/README.md` for details.

This project contains no game assets. It is a tool that converts text inside a
database file that the user already owns on their own device.
